{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvQmVhbiUyMCUyODE5OTclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Bean","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/IwrDPrB4d2DMcpnGkvan46yINL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xvBvwR3NWn1K8YcByJJhB7pYoKu.jpg","description":"Childlike Englishman, Mr. Bean, is an incompetent watchman at the Royal National Gallery. After the museum's board of directors' attempt to have him fired is blocked by the chairman, who has taken a liking to Bean, they send him to Los Angeles to act as their ambassador for the unveiling of a historic painting to humiliate him. Fooled, Mr. Bean must now successfully unveil the painting or risk his and a hapless Los Angeles curator's termination.","releaseInfo":"1997","genres":["Family","Adventure","Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"89 min","cast":["Rowan Atkinson","Peter MacNicol","Pamela Reed","Harris Yulin","Burt Reynolds","Larry Drake","Chris Ellis","Johnny Galecki"],"director":["Mel Smith"],"released":"1997-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"One man. One masterpiece. One very big mistake.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Rowan Atkinson","character":"Mr. Bean","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gdiN2zLjC3Mnfrp7hM3TXVJjWJv.jpg"},{"name":"Peter MacNicol","character":"David Langley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8gizugTP8hykdfBkOY0Qg0aqpiP.jpg"},{"name":"Pamela Reed","character":"Alison Langley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xnl8fp434SpB2e1iPw7NpEcYHNd.jpg"},{"name":"Harris Yulin","character":"George Grierson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3W758yxhdphzblpgDz4wKgLCriB.jpg"},{"name":"Burt Reynolds","character":"General Newton","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5FNuc4f1OR9EF9QcrcnFIr3zZQr.jpg"},{"name":"Larry Drake","character":"Elmer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/VkS3sb0gpLEY0AW7M92RO0m60b.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Ellis","character":"Detective Butler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w